import ../../site/games/farm/camera.dl

set state to a website Farm camera in (UI box at 10.0 20.0 sized 640.0 360.0)
require condition ((state's overview) and ((UI scene orbit (the address of (state's orbit)) is moving) = false)) reporting "The initial Farm overview animated or was not framed"
set distance to state's orbit's distance
resize website Farm camera (the address of state) to (UI box at 100.0 200.0 sized 320.0 640.0)
require condition ((state's orbit's distance > distance) and (state's orbit's camera's aspect = 0.5)) reporting "A tall Farm viewport retained the old camera distance or aspect"
require condition (state's orbit's maximum distance >= state's orbit's distance) reporting "Resizing left the overview outside its manual zoom limits"
require condition (state's orbit's camera's far > state's orbit's distance + 20.0) reporting "The resized Farm view exceeded its far plane"
set previous to state's orbit's camera's position
turn website Farm camera (the address of state) by pixels (a UI point at 20.0 and 10.0)
set changed to advance UI scene orbit (the address of (state's orbit)) by 1.0 seconds
require condition (((state's overview) = false) and ((the length of (state's orbit's camera's position - previous)) > 0.01)) reporting "Farm right-drag did not move the shared camera"
set previous to state's orbit's camera's position
resize website Farm camera (the address of state) to (UI box at 0.0 0.0 sized 960.0 540.0)
require condition ((the length of (state's orbit's camera's position - previous)) < 0.000001) reporting "Resizing teleported a manually positioned Farm camera"
set distance to state's orbit's desired distance
zoom website Farm camera (the address of state) by wheel -120.0
require condition (state's orbit's desired distance < distance) reporting "Farm wheel input did not zoom toward the scene"
set previous to state's orbit's desired target
pan website Farm camera (the address of state) by pixels (a UI point at 20.0 and -10.0)
require condition ((the length of (state's orbit's desired target - previous)) > 0.01) reporting "Farm pan input did not move its shared focus target"
show the whole Farm through (the address of state) over 0.65 seconds
require condition ((state's overview) and (UI scene orbit (the address of (state's orbit)) is moving)) reporting "The whole-farm action did not start a smooth focus transition"
set changed to advance UI scene orbit (the address of (state's orbit)) by 0.65 seconds
require condition ((UI scene orbit (the address of (state's orbit)) is moving) = false) reporting "The Farm overview kept drawing after its focus transition finished"
set target to a UI scene vector from [3.0,1.0,-2.0]
focus website Farm camera (the address of state) on target viewed from (a UI scene vector from [5.0,6.0,4.0]) over 0.65 seconds
set changed to advance UI scene orbit (the address of (state's orbit)) by 0.65 seconds
resize website Farm camera (the address of state) to (UI box at 0.0 0.0 sized 500.0 500.0)
require condition (((state's overview) = false) and ((the length of (state's orbit's camera's target - target)) < 0.000001)) reporting "Resizing discarded the selected Farm camera target"
print line "Farm camera input uses shared motion, refits portrait viewports, preserves manual placement on resize and returns smoothly to the full landscape."
